 "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984449_1271730923402431_2974811882698929158_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQD-2pqn0pMQ7kNvwG4DJhU&_nc_oc=AdqEj9NZTt-04MTS8euDQbJA2omn_OMx3O0j8TrHrpPplE9KIrOiNv0DSluLq-5WU3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQf7QztENhqHKy1bhn51DMmsNFqu0P2CLbESHZPOOlscw&oe=6AFDD525"}, "display_name": "Glory Tank", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Thanksgiving, thanks for  meeting, we have just entered the ranks of VR game production for love, for love, we choose the tank series, there may be some shortcomings, but we are very willing to hear your feedback, so we will start it for you for free during Thanksgiving, Come on, friends, and give us your best feedback.\n\nGlory Tank is a multiplayer online VR competitive game. Players drive tanks to participate in 1v1, 2v2, and 3v3 PVP battles and can communicate with teammates to cooperate. In a limited time, defeat the enemy, occupy the opponent's base, and win the final team glory.\n\nTank upgrades:\n\nEvery time you win, you will get corresponding experience, you can upgrade your military rank, and then you can get skill points, through which you can upgrade your tanks.", "short_description": "Glory Tank is a multiplayer online VR competitive game. Players drive tanks to participate in 1v1, 2v2, and 3v3 PVP battles and can communicate with teammates to cooperate. In a limited time, defeat the enemy, occupy the opponent's base, and win the final team glory."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.glorytank.com/index.php?id=policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Beijing GOFT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.glorytank.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"